## Critical Rules

1. Never guess API signatures. If unsure whether a method exists (e.g. `Util.GetVerticalAngle`, `world.FindActorsOnLine`), say so. Check `engine/` for reference if needed.
2. Prefer engine patches over mod-side workarounds when the user has source access.
